Reservation of the Pre-sanctified Chrism
طقس إيداع الخميرة
The leaven (from the presanctified Myron) can be added either once or in three installments, in which case three liturgies are celebrated during the same week and the leaven of the Myron and the Hagelion are added at the conclusion of each. As for the readings of these liturgies, they are as follows:
